      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>A Mi SheBerakh for the 70th anniversary of the bar mitzvah ceremony, referred to by some as a “Ḥanukat Bar Mitzvah” or “second bar mitsvah.” Written for the ḥanukat bar mitzvah of the author’s grandfather, 30 August 2015.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>Note: “<j:divineName>The Place</j:divineName>” is a direct translation of the divine referent, <j:divineName>ha-Maqom</j:divineName>. All divine referents (pronouns, epithets, names) are rendered in unicase.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_63200_introduction"/>
